{
  "metadata": {
    "name": "A1v2 \u00b7 prior + lookahead 0.6",
    "description": "Stage 10 (2026-08-31): the prior aims, the lookahead makes it timely.  The stage-9 lesion proved the barrier is not the HK storm: prior-only C ties passive-limp.  A 0.1 s-e-fold topple against a ~2-tick sense-command-servo delay means feedback on the MEASURED state is always late \u2014 and v2 already owns the built, gain-0-guarded fix (rung 1, lookahead_gain): feed the controller x_eff = (1-l)x + l*x_hat through its own forward model.  Composition: aim (state prior) + timeliness (lookahead).  Arm: lookahead 0.6.",
    "env_target": "microduck",
    "phase_tag": "A1 (first brain)",
    "scaffolds_active": [
      "alpha_stand.onnx via the A2 recovery harness \u2014 drives only while the body is down, with all learning rates zeroed"
    ]
  },
